#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:5
msgid "Paste part"
msgstr "粘贴部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech element editor allows pasting the different possible `type of "
"parts`_ which have already been copied or cut from the `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 元件编辑器允许粘贴各种 `部件类型 <type of parts_>`_ ，这些部件已从 `绘图区 <drawing "
"area_>`_ 复制或剪切。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:12
msgid ""
"Multiples `parts`_ can be pasted at the same time, check `copy part`_ or "
"`cut part`_ section to check how multiples `parts`_ can be copied or cut."
msgstr ""
"可以同时粘贴多个 `部件 <parts_>`_ ；有关如何复制或剪切多个 `部件 <parts_>`_ 的说明，请参见 `复制部件 <copy "
"part_>`_ 或 `剪切部件 <cut part_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:16
msgid ""
"Pasting `parts`_ can be done from `menu bar`_, by right click on the "
"`drawing area`_ and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_、右键点击 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 或相应的快捷键来粘贴 `部件 "
"<parts_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:20
msgid "Paste part from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏粘贴部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:22
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Paste** menu item to paste the `part`_ copied or cut "
"previously from `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **编辑 > 粘贴** 菜单项，粘贴此前从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 复制或剪切的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:27
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器“编辑”菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:30
msgid "Paste part by right click"
msgstr "通过右键粘贴部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:32
msgid "Right click somewhere from `drawing area`_."
msgstr "在 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 的任意位置点击右键。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select the option **Paste** to paste the `part`_ copied or cut previously."
msgstr "选择 **粘贴** 选项，粘贴此前复制或剪切的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 右键弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:41
msgid "Paste part using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用快捷键粘贴部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:43
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:45
msgid ""
"Press ``Ctrl + v`` to paste the `part`_ copied or cut previously from "
"`drawing area`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + v`` 粘贴此前从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 复制或剪切的 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:49
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/paste.rst:53
msgid ""
"The procedure defined at this section only allows pasting the `parts`_ at "
"the right grid point from the copied or cut `part`_ position. To be able to "
"choose the place where the `part`_ has to be pasted, refer to `paste in "
"area`_ section."
msgstr ""
"本节所述方法只能将 `部件 <parts_>`_ 粘贴到与复制或剪切时 `部件 <part_>`_ 位置对齐的网格点上。若要自行选择 `部件 "
"<part_>`_ 的粘贴位置，请参见 `在区域内粘贴 <paste in area_>`_ 一节。"
